# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Data. None of it is redistributable; CLEVER sits at the root of the
# repository (see the README).
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# dados/ holds the labels of the candidate removals and everything the
# pipeline writes from CLEVER: content plans, generated articles and energy
# records. Plans and articles carry claim spans and news text.
dados/
*.jsonl

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Evaluation outputs: judge caches, per-article results and aggregates. They
# hold per-article judge decisions, with justifications that quote the
# articles; metric values belong in the dissertation.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
evaluation/outputs/
*.csv

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Credentials and environment. The Gemini key lives in .env in this folder.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.env
.env.*
*.env
*.key
*.pem
id_*

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Python
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
.venv-*/
venv/
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# OS
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
._*
Thumbs.db
